WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.389
Start a new temporary chat and attach the chapter PDF.

00:00:06.389 --> 00:00:06.807
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:10.307
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:10.307 --> 00:00:10.631
Send the second message containing the shortcut.

00:00:10.631 --> 00:00:11.513
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:15.143
View the generated flashcards before starting the review.

00:00:15.144 --> 00:00:19.677
Recall the first answer, then flip the card to check it.

00:00:19.677 --> 00:00:23.526
Flip back to the question and try recalling the distinction again.

00:00:23.526 --> 00:00:27.374
Reveal the answer again before marking your recall.

00:00:27.374 --> 00:00:30.652
Mark this distinction as known and move to card two.

00:00:30.652 --> 00:00:35.484
Read the context question, reveal the answer, and compare it with the chapter.

00:00:35.484 --> 00:00:39.840
Mark this card as needing more practice.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.117
Reveal the third answer about probability versus truth.

00:00:43.117 --> 00:00:46.358
Finish the three-card review and inspect the learning summary.

00:00:46.358 --> 00:00:50.742
Retry only the missed card instead of restarting the whole deck.

00:00:50.742 --> 00:00:55.612
Recall the difficult distinction, then reveal its explanation again.

00:00:55.612 --> 00:01:02.629
Finish the targeted retry and inspect the new result.
